
 (1) Hotness sample

 Find the highest resolution to establish dominant Basic blocks.

 Under Performance -> Hotspot

 Select HW Event sampling (run as administrator and if prompted install sampling driver)

 Select 0.01ms. I believe most Intel CPUs support 27~33us hardware sampling.

 I have tested i7-8700K and i9-13900KS thus far

 (2) To validate, select a region under Platform view with CPU core activity smaller than sampling window and make sure
     Bottom-up shows some functions with sampling period.

     For e.g., if you selected sampling period 10us and a 15us region selected shows 1 sample with 27us then you know the CPU only supports 27us sampling


 // 10GB data limit
  vtune -collect hotspots -knob sampling-mode=hw -knob sampling-interval=0.01 -knob enable-characterization-insights=false -data-limit=10000 --target-process process_name.exe

